WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Connected with aih ssh leibo-asus. Save a variable and the shell PID.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:09.100
This is OpenSSH: type ~? at the start of a line for escape help.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:16.380
Turn Wi-Fi off. AIHerd keeps the remote shell while retrying.

4
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.470
The red banner reports the stalled connection and automatic retries.

5
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:26.000
Wi-Fi is back on. AIHerd retries until the network is ready.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Reconnection wait shortened. The same SSH shell continues after recovery.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The PID is still 2358897, and the saved variable is still here.
